<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Conferma Ordine {{ order.orderNumber }}</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 150px 50px 80px 50px;
        }

        header {
            position: absolute;
            top: -120px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 100px;
        }

        footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -60px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 50px;
            border-top: 1px solid #005691;
            padding-top: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #005691;
        }

        .header-logo-left {
            float: left;
            width: 300px;
        }

        .header-logo-right {
            float: right;
            width: 100px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #000;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .content {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .header {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header-top {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .customer-info {
            margin-left: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .subject {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .disclaimer {
            font-size: 9px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        table.items {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border: 1px solid black;
        }

        table.items th, table.items td {
            border-left: 1px solid black;
            border-right: 1px solid black;
            padding: 4px;
            text-align: left;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        table.items th {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 13px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
        }

        .center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .footer-info {
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .conditions-box {
            border: 1px solid black;
            padding: 5px;
            font-size: 9px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .signature-box {
            width: 100%;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .signature-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            height: 2px;
        }

        .bold {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .uppercase {
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .page-break {
            page-break-before: always;
        }

        .privacy-page {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .privacy-footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -50px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
        }

        .privacy-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .privacy-text {
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin-bottom: 13px;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <img src="{{ app_root }}/public/images/logo_treemme_intestazione.png" class="header-logo-left" alt="logo_treemme">
    <img src="{{ app_root }}/public/images/logo_lvg_intestazione.png" class="header-logo-right" alt="logo_lvg">
</header>

<footer>
    CONCERIA TRE EMME S.r.l. a Socio Unico Via Marconi, 3/1 - 36050 Zermeghedo (VI) - Italy - Telefono +39 0444
    484233<br>
    mmarcolungo@treemmeconceria.com - R.E.A. VI 341788 - Registro Imprese VI/Codice Fiscale e Partita IVA IT 00532550241
    - C.S. € 500.000,00 i.v.
</footer>

<div class="content">
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-top">
            ZERMEGHEDO {{ order.orderDate ? order.orderDate|date('d/m/Y') : '' }}
        </div>

        <span class="bold">SPETT. LE &nbsp;&nbsp; {{ order.client ? order.client.name : '' }}</span><br><br>
        <div class="customer-info">
            {% set sedeAddress = null %}
            {% if order.client %}
                {% for contactAddress in order.client.contactAddresses %}
                    {% if contactAddress.addressName == 'SEDE' %}
                        {% set sedeAddress = contactAddress %}
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            {% endif %}

            {% if sedeAddress %}
                {{ sedeAddress.address }}<br>

                {% if sedeAddress.address2 %}
                    {{ sedeAddress.address2 }}<br>
                {% endif %}

                {% if sedeAddress.address3 %}
                    {{ sedeAddress.address3 }}<br>
                {% endif %}

                {{ sedeAddress.zipCode ? sedeAddress.zipCode ~ ' ' : '' }}
                {{ sedeAddress.nation ? sedeAddress.nation.name : '' }}
            {% elseif order.address %}
                {{ order.address.address }}<br>

                {% if order.address.address2 %}
                    {{ order.address.address2 }}<br>
                {% endif %}

                {% if order.address.address3 %}
                    {{ order.address.address3 }}<br>
                {% endif %}

                {{ order.address.zipCode ? order.address.zipCode ~ ' ' : '' }}
                {{ order.address.nation ? order.address.nation.name : '' }}
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            OGGETTO: CONFERMA VOSTRO ORDINE &nbsp; {{ order.agentOrderNumber ? order.agentOrderNumber : order.clientOrderNumber }}
            DEL {{ order.agentOrderDate ? order.agentOrderDate|date('d/m/Y') : (order.clientOrderDate ? order.clientOrderDate|date('d/m/Y'): '') }} &nbsp; NOSTRO
            RIF {{ order.orderNumber }}
        </div>

        <div class="disclaimer">
            ATTENDIAMO VOSTRO GENTILE E SOLLECITO RISCONTRO ENTRO 7 GG DALLA DATA DEL PRESENTE DOCUMENTO, TRASCORSI I
            QUALI SI CONSIDERERA' TACITAMENTE ACCETTATO.
        </div>
    </div>

    <table class="items">
        <thead>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">N</th>
            <th style="width: 35%;">ARTICOLO</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;">NOTE RIF. CLIENTE</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;" class="center">QUANTITA'</th>
            <th style="width: 12%;" class="right">PREZZO</th>
            <th style="width: 13%;" class="center">DATA PRV</th>
        </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
        {% for row in order.clientOrderRows %}
            <tr>
                <td class="center">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td>
                    {% if row.article %}
                        {{ row.article.clientCode ?: row.article.name }}
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td>
                    {% if row.article %}
                        {{  row.article.clientCodeNote }}
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td class="center">
                    {{ row.measurementUnit ? row.measurementUnit.prefix : '' }} &nbsp; {{ row.quantity }}
                </td>
                <td class="right">
                    {{ row.currency ? row.currency.sign : '' }} &nbsp; {{ row.currencyPrice|number_format(2, ',', '.') }}
                </td>
                <td class="center">
                    {{ row.deliveryDateConfirmed ? row.deliveryDateConfirmed|date('d/m/Y') : '' }}
                </td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}

        {% if order.clientOrderRows|length < 13 %}
            {% for i in range(order.clientOrderRows|length + 1, 13) %}
                <tr>
                    <td style="height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td>
                    <td>&nbsp;</td>
                    <td>&nbsp;</td>
                    <td>&nbsp;</td>
                    <td>&nbsp;</td>
                    <td>&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="footer-info">
        <p class="bold italic" style="margin-bottom: 0; font-style: oblique;">CONDIZIONI D 'ORDINE</p>
        <div class="signature-line" style="width: 50%; margin-top: 0; "></div>
        <p><span class="bold">PAGAMENTO:</span> {{ order.payment ? order.payment.name : '' }}</p>
        <p><span class="bold">RESA MERCE:</span> {{ order.shipmentCondition ? order.shipmentCondition.name : '' }}</p>
        {% if order.shippingCarrier %}
            <p><span class="bold">VETTORE:</span> {{ order.shippingCarrier.name }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if order.address and (order.address.addressName|trim == 'DEST. DIVERSA'|trim) %}
            <p><span class="bold"> DEST. DIVERSA:</span>{{ order.address.address }},

                {% if order.address.address2 %}
                    {{ order.address.address2 }},
                {% endif %}

                {% if order.address.address3 %}
                    {{ order.address.address3 }}
                {% endif %}

                {{ order.address.zipCode ? order.address.zipCode ~ ' ' : '' }}
                {{ order.address.nation ? order.address.nation.name : '' }}</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <table class="footer-bottom">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 60%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div class="conditions-box">
                    <p class="bold" style="margin-top: 0;">CONDIZIONI GENERALI DI FORNITURA:</p>
                    <p>LA MERCE VIAGGIA A RISCHIO E PERICOLO DEL COMMITTENTE ANCHE SE VENDUTA FRANCO DESTINO. NON SI
                        ACCETTANO RECLAMI TRASCORSI 8 GG DALL'ARRIVO DELLA MERCE E NON SI ACCETTANO RESI SENZA
                        AUTORIZZAZIONE.<br>
                        PER NECESSITA' DI CARATTERE PRODUTTIVO E DI APPROVIGIONAMENTO, LA DATA DI CONSEGNA DEL PELLAME
                        HA UNA TOLLERANZA AMMISSIBILE DI 15 GG DI RITARDO. LA QUANTITA' CONSEGNATA PUO' AVERE VARIAZIONI
                        ENTRO IL 40% IN PIU' O IN MENO RISPETTO ALLA QUANTITA' ORDINATA, SALVO CONTRATTAZIONE SPECIFICA
                        TRA IL COMMITTENTE E LA SADA.</p>
                </div>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 2%;"></td>
            <td style="width: 38%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div class="signature-box">
                    <p class="bold" style="margin-top: 0;">PER ACCETTAZIONE</p>
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                    <p class="bold">DATA</p>
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                    <p class="bold">TIMBRO E FIRMA</p>
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
</body>
</html>
